    "detail": {
      "id": 1320801,
      "name": "[Tsukishiro Yanagi] Soaring Moonlight",
      "desc": "During <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack: Gekka Ruten</color>, after performing a quick thrust, Tsukishiro Yanagi hovers in midair, <color=#2BAD00>continuously channeling thunderbolt strikes into the ground</color>, and dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>. Tsukishiro Yanagi triggers the downward smash from <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack: Gekka Ruten</color> by releasing or pressing Special Attack <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> again, or when the duration limit is reached. When her thunderbolt strikes hit enemies, it <color=#2BAD00>increases the Disorder DMG they take by 3%</color>, stacking up to 20 times and lasting 6s. Repeated triggers reset the duration. When <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack: Gekka Ruten</color>'s heavy attack hits enemies, Tsukishiro Yanagi gains shield equal to 20% of her Max HP, lasting 20s, triggering up to once per 20s.",
